{
  "about": "Where every link in MDARIX lands (quality plan stage 6). places: each workspace screen of the MVP feature set (every free trial and pilot), its address and its tabs. records: where each kind of record opens, and the address parameter that names it. viewIds: the stable id under which each screen remembers its lists' column choices (a screen that moves or is renamed keeps its id). oldViews, oldSections and oldTabs: every former address and section name, and the place that holds it now; kept permanently, so e-mails already sent, bookmarks, videos and guides keep working. Read by app/linkTable.ts and, for the server's links, by tests/test_link_targets.py. newPlaces, newMenu, newRecords and newHomes (stage 7, 0.10.68): the screens of the new navigation, its menu, where each record opens there, and the new home of every screen and tab above; they apply only to an organization on the new navigation (tenants.navigation = new). classicHomes: where an address of the new navigation opens for an organization on the classic one. 0.10.73 (Release C, C1): the new navigation's tabs (newMenu.main) are Home (My work), Complaints, Decision trees, Reports, Investigations, Trends, Records and Team; each persona shows some of them (access_control/personas.py).",
